effort= <p>An optional <code>effort</code> attribute overrides the configured request effort for one task. Valid values are <code>low</code>, <code>medium</code>, <code>high</code>, <code>xhigh</code>, <code>max</code>, and <code>no</code> (send no effort); availability depends on the selected model and endpoint. A task without <code>effort=</code> inherits its tier's effort suffix, or the session effort (<code>AI_ASSIST_EFFORT</code>), or the provider default when unset. Effort does not change the model's thinking mode.</p> <pre><code>@task quick_lookup effort=low
Goal: Find the matching job.
@end

@task investigate effort=high
Goal: Explain the root cause.
@end
</code></pre>
